# ---------------------------------------------------------------- frexp, ldexp, scalbn, ilogb, logb, modf
frexpDouble is operation
frexpDouble purpose "frexp: x as a fraction of magnitude in [0.5, 1) times 2 to a power, which is stored through the pointer; 0, infinity, and NaN give x + x and the power 0"
frexpDouble invariant splitsFraction "\"Gives a fraction of magnitude in [0.5, 1) and stores the power of two that restores x\""
frexpDouble typeParameter none
frexpDouble input x Float64 copied
frexpDouble input exponentAt machine.Address copied
frexpDouble output Float64
